    <text>
      <eigenschaft>text</eigenschaft>
      <text><![CDATA[Vorkenntnisse: Kompetenzstufe A2/B1.
Kursmaterial: "Headway B1 Part One", Oxford University Press, (Gesamtpaket, ISBN: 9780194716550), bitte zum Kurs mitbringen.
Kursinhalt:  Lektion 6-10.
Course topics are: Describing a place, comparing things, talking about towns and sightseeing. Tourist destinations and travelling. Interviewing and talking about famous people, biographies. Do's and don'ts.Talking about discoveries and inventions. Expressing obligation, asking for and giving advice. Discussing pros and cons.
Grammar: Comparative and superlative adjectives, present perfect vs past smple, present perfect continuous. Time clauses; first conditional.; passives.
Bitte beachten Sie: dieser Kurs ist auch unabhängig vom Vorgängerkurs Nk-F540c buchbar.]]></text>
    </text>
